WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.854
Check connection. Overview badges include earlier saved results.

00:00:05.854 --> 00:00:07.331
ASR: inspect the known English audio and query service languages.

00:00:07.331 --> 00:00:20.967
Submit the sample to the phone ASR service and inspect its returned text.

00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:24.754
Returned transcript: the weather is sunny today. This is one sample.

00:00:24.754 --> 00:00:26.324
TTS uses the independent Kokoro runtime on phone CPU, not the FIH TTS service.

00:00:26.324 --> 00:01:05.316
Generate on the phone. Model loading and USB transfer take additional time.

00:01:05.316 --> 00:01:07.262
Inspect the actual WAV result, timings and runtime warnings.

00:01:07.262 --> 00:01:13.715
Play on the computer. Soundtrack uses this run’s generated WAV.
